**Summary:**  
These patches add `legendProps` (and for RadioButtonGroup, also `fieldsetProps`) to allow passing custom attributes (like `id` and `aria-labelledby`) to the `<legend>` and `<fieldset>`, enabling full a11y support as described in the bug report.
